# Frontend Architecture

## Structure
- Entry: [frontend/src/index.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/index.tsx)
- App shell: [frontend/src/App.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/App.tsx)
- Components: [frontend/src/components](mdc:frontend/src/components)
- Hooks: [frontend/src/hooks](mdc:frontend/src/hooks)
- API services: [frontend/src/services](mdc:frontend/src/services)
- Types: [frontend/src/types](mdc:frontend/src/types)
- Styles: [frontend/src/styles](mdc:frontend/src/styles)

## Rules
- Keep components presentational; business logic in hooks/services.
- Use `types` for API contracts shared with backend DTOs.
- Debounce user input in search ([frontend/src/hooks/useDebounce.ts](mdc:frontend/src/hooks/useDebounce.ts)).
- Keep API calls centralized (e.g., [frontend/src/services/candidateApi.ts](mdc:frontend/src/services/candidateApi.ts)).
- Prefer controlled components for forms; validate via [frontend/src/utils/formValidator.ts](mdc:frontend/src/utils/formValidator.ts).

## Testing
- Component tests under [frontend/src/tests/components](mdc:frontend/src/tests/components)
- App-level tests in [frontend/src/tests/App.test.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/tests/App.test.tsx)

